。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Xco_dependent/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb60b34f/uploads/origins/01f76481-9654-4151-8b75-7e1265e8fcf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1d5ec18ee2ec348b93169323db6fac9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb60b34f/uploads/origins/01f76481-9654-4151-8b75-7e1265e8fcf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1d5ec18ee2ec348b93169323db6fac9, https://si.imgix.net/cb60b34f/uploads/origins/01f76481-9654-4151-8b75-7e1265e8fcf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ea0fb585c6d30e6343e295705faf10e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb60b34f/uploads/origins/01f76481-9654-4151-8b75-7e1265e8fcf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c55b5c3e2ccd94d0f7d39f7a4e4d2e8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ふぃあ様\n\n初めまして、この度は私のocであるドジっ子くまさんメイドを描いて頂きたくリクエストいたしました！\n資料を参考にアレンジ等大歓迎ですので、可愛く描いていただけたら嬉しいです ︎︎ᕷ\n素敵なご縁がございましたら、よろしくお願いいたします୨୧\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/FLcMUBzaiYsZYS3AA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Xco_dependent/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/637cb404/uploads/origins/0fb7250b-9eb0-4819-9a96-7b8fb74b5209?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e9bdcd284cde023af6ce6ec41993553", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/637cb404/uploads/origins/0fb7250b-9eb0-4819-9a96-7b8fb74b5209?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e9bdcd284cde023af6ce6ec41993553, https://si.imgix.net/637cb404/uploads/origins/0fb7250b-9eb0-4819-9a96-7b8fb74b5209?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89efe2e63ff28da2c433fd2ec7373e38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/637cb404/uploads/origins/0fb7250b-9eb0-4819-9a96-7b8fb74b5209?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf7561ea423b5af0cef48d1d6846b973 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hi!! your art is very cute and i would like an illustration of my original character!!! i love both of your styles (pixel and non pixel)!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/28354417.clio/gallery\nshe is a very happy, energetic, cute, playful, and oblivious character! she likes videogames, desserts, and cute things!\n\nfeel free to draw her in any outfit you like, or even a custom outfit!\n\nthank you very much for considering my request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Xco_dependent/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a639789a/uploads/origins/0f1c9456-0a23-4a26-8670-aa15fea56102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f02a3efd915cd8cd3a98d157484f063", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a639789a/uploads/origins/0f1c9456-0a23-4a26-8670-aa15fea56102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f02a3efd915cd8cd3a98d157484f063, https://si.imgix.net/a639789a/uploads/origins/0f1c9456-0a23-4a26-8670-aa15fea56102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bae190410b7a7a2d17795bf838102a79 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a639789a/uploads/origins/0f1c9456-0a23-4a26-8670-aa15fea56102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdcd10018997ba92312c6ed95e5ca442 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのピクセルアートと非ピクセルアートのスタイルはとても美しくてキュートで、一目惚れしました！\n\n私のVtuber、Lily Avenderaのアートワークが欲しいです！彼女はイチゴからエネルギーを得ている、花の力を持つ魔法の猫娘で、とても遊び好きでキュートです！\n\n彼女の参考シートはこちら：https://ibb.co/N91MCrR\n\n背景とポーズはお任せします！ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://ibb.co/N91MCrR", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Xco_dependent/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa7354f4/uploads/origins/39f2f3a8-24b4-408b-9f9f-91f2c5c94064?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d88daa7774eaf44e822795f3c168c569", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aa7354f4/uploads/origins/39f2f3a8-24b4-408b-9f9f-91f2c5c94064?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d88daa7774eaf44e822795f3c168c569, https://si.imgix.net/aa7354f4/uploads/origins/39f2f3a8-24b4-408b-9f9f-91f2c5c94064?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b151718c91be5daa438bc2408bd3c53f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aa7354f4/uploads/origins/39f2f3a8-24b4-408b-9f9f-91f2c5c94064?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77124d64b13db0670fa8db414286a325 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hi! I love your art! it’s so cute ♡ \n\ncould you please draw my character? she is an elf with a motherly personality who loves to be kind and make people happy. She lives in a majestic forest and cares for the animals of the forest, including a few lambs and the deer. \n\nPlease don’t forget her light freckles and the mole under her eye and her necklace. \n\nPose and expression are up to you! \n\nThank you so much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KIPWBI31OSGvMwh0T7yhu1vpGcjDiII3", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Xco_dependent/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2f4aa99/uploads/origins/b505c8fe-d7fe-4bc7-aae4-edcd23def07b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72b9445d8dbd4db5f35e4111b60e454c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2f4aa99/uploads/origins/b505c8fe-d7fe-4bc7-aae4-edcd23def07b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72b9445d8dbd4db5f35e4111b60e454c, https://si.imgix.net/c2f4aa99/uploads/origins/b505c8fe-d7fe-4bc7-aae4-edcd23def07b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff58bcf2a260d51f31d59c0b299abdf3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2f4aa99/uploads/origins/b505c8fe-d7fe-4bc7-aae4-edcd23def07b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=035b56a31df4f55be3475e785249e9d